# TinySMS: what Bob builds. The phone app is a signed Android APK (no Android SDK needed) — the SMS node
# that sends and receives on the phone's own SIM for the TinySMS gateway. One command; one app to hand over.

@Recipe TinySMS
Version=TinySMS.vml:Version

@Build Android
Machine=here
Kind=apk
Form=apps/TinySMS.vml
